    <string name="about_body">Movo is a media player for Android phones, tablets and TV. It uses your own HDRezka account — the session key stays in the Android Keystore and is never sent anywhere else. Compared to the website you get a proper TV interface, exact resume positions, voice search, and EN/RU/UK localization.</string>
